  "acceptance_rules": [
    "Group by state: Expired (red), DueForRenewal (amber, days_left), Valid, NoExpiry; filter by kind and category. An expired entry with renewal_applied_on shows the application.",
    "Add: kind, category, title, authority, reference, dates (a licence needs valid_until, a plan its review date), the official (GET /facility/staff: user_id), the equipment it covers; then attach the scan (multipart, PDF or image).",
    "Renewal applied for: PUT with renewal_applied_on and the receipt as the scan. Renewed: POST .../renew (a new entry replaces the old one; attach the new scan). No longer needed: withdraw with the reason.",
    "Print the register for the inspector (register/pdf)."
  ],
